  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Consultancy follow-up FDC Tanzania</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Consultancy follow-up FDC Tanzania</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sida financed the establishment of 52 Folk Development Colleges (FDC) for 25 years (1970-1995). FDC&apos;s have not only survived but increased in numbers to 55 FDCs. A follow-up and shorter study aims to compile a document for publication about one case study of &quot;Life After Aid&quot;, as an example of long-term results in the development cooperation. Direct call-off is justified by the low cost, no fees will be paid and the Consultant has previously conducted an evaluation of FDC&apos;s for Sida.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sida finansierade 52 Folkh&#xf6;gskolor (Folk Development Colleges FDC) under 25 &#xe5;r (1970-1995). FDC&apos;s har inte bara &#xf6;verlevt utan &#xe4;ven blivit fler till antalet, nu 55 st. En uppf&#xf6;ljning och kortare studie syftar till att sammanst&#xe4;lla ett dokument f&#xf6;r publicering av en fallstudie om &quot;Life after Aid&quot;, som ett exempel p&#xe5; l&#xe5;ngsiktiga resultat i bist&#xe5;ndet. Direktupphanding motiveras av det l&#xe5;ga beloppet, att ingen ers&#xe4;ttning betalas i arvode samt att konsulten tidigare genomf&#xf6;rt utv&#xe4;rdering av Sida insats till FDCs.</narrative>
  </description>
